# REFERENCE FILE - do not copy this file over the live unit.
#
# This is what /etc/systemd/system/roe_ui.service must look like after the
# cutover. Only ONE line changes. It is the ExecStart line.
#
#   before:  ... --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
#   after:   ... --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8001
#
# Why: after the cutover Caddy owns port 8000. Caddy forwards to roe_ui on
# port 8001. roe_ui listens on 127.0.0.1 only, so nothing but Caddy can reach
# it. roe_ui's own code does not change at all.
#
# How to make the change: deploy/scripts/cutover.sh edits the live file in
# place with one search-and-replace, prints the diff, and refuses to continue
# if more than one line changed. Editing in place is safer than replacing the
# file, because the live file may carry [Unit] or [Install] lines that are not
# reproduced here.
#
# The [Service] section below is the part that must match after the change.
# Everything else in the live file stays exactly as it is today.

[Service]
Type=simple
User=roe_ui_app
Group=roe_ui_app
WorkingDirectory=/opt/roe_ui/backend
EnvironmentFile=/etc/roe_ui.env
ExecStart=/opt/roe_ui/backend/.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8001
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=3
